bzip2: reading and writing of bzip2 compressed files and strings, with
the bzip2 library of the base system.

The module bz2 of PHP 8.2 for php82 of azsupport/ports, which installs
side by side with the other versions of PHP: lib/php/20220829/bz2.so,
loaded by its ini in etc/php82/conf.d, its headers in
include/php82/php/ext/bz2.
